✅ 你要找的是「TS_CUST_ID 一對多 SK_CUST_ID」的案例
推薦 SQL 查詢（直接 Copy 用）
SELECT 
    TS_CUST_ID,
    COUNT(DISTINCT SK_CUST_ID) AS SK_COUNT,
    STRING_AGG(SK_CUST_ID, ', ') AS SK_LIST,           -- 把所有 SK 列出來
    COUNT(*) AS ROW_COUNT,
    MIN(CUST_RE_NO_FL) AS MIN_FLAG,
    MAX(CUST_RE_NO_FL) AS MAX_FLAG
FROM BANCS_SK_CUST_INFO
GROUP BY TS_CUST_ID
HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT SK_CUST_ID) > 1
ORDER BY SK_COUNT DESC, TS_CUST_ID;

如果你只要看 Flag 是 1、2、3 的
SELECT 
    TS_CUST_ID,
    COUNT(DISTINCT SK_CUST_ID) AS SK_COUNT,
    STRING_AGG(SK_CUST_ID, ', ') AS SK_LIST,
    STRING_AGG(CAST(CUST_RE_NO_FL AS VARCHAR), ', ') AS FLAGS
FROM BANCS_SK_CUST_INFO
WHERE CUST_RE_NO_FL IN (1, 2, 3)
GROUP BY TS_CUST_ID
HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT SK_CUST_ID) > 1
ORDER BY SK_COUNT DESC;

更詳細版（包含 CUST_NO 等資訊）
SELECT 
    t.TS_CUST_ID,
    t.SK_COUNT,
    s.SK_CUST_ID,
    s.CUST_NO,
    s.CUST_RE_NO_FL
FROM (
    SELECT 
        TS_CUST_ID,
        COUNT(DISTINCT SK_CUST_ID) AS SK_COUNT
    FROM BANCS_SK_CUST_INFO
    GROUP BY TS_CUST_ID
    HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT SK_CUST_ID) > 1
) t
JOIN BANCS_SK_CUST_INFO s ON t.TS_CUST_ID = s.TS_CUST_ID
ORDER BY t.TS_CUST_ID, s.SK_CUST_ID;

解釋：
	•	TS_CUST_ID 一對多 → COUNT(DISTINCT SK_CUST_ID) > 1
	•	你提到的 Flag 有 2 或 3，也有 1 → 可以用 WHERE CUST_RE_NO_FL IN (1,2,3) 過濾
	•	STRING_AGG 可以一次看到所有對應的 SK_CUST_ID（方便檢查）

想再調整的話告訴我：
	1	要不要只看特定 Flag？
	2	要不要把 CUST_NO 也一起顯示？
	3	資料量很大嗎？需要加 TOP 100 或分頁嗎？
直接執行第一個查詢看看結果，應該就能抓到你想要的「一對多」案例了！
